          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.1+2SA.7.2+2SA.7.3+2SA.7.4+2SA.7.5+2SA.7.6+2SA.7.7+2SA.7.8+2SA.7.9+2SA.7.10+2SA.7.11+2SA.7.12+2SA.7.13+2SA.7.14+2SA.7.15+2SA.7.16+2SA.7.17+2SA.7.18+2SA.7.19+2SA.7.20+2SA.7.21+2SA.7.22+2SA.7.23+2SA.7.24+2SA.7.25+2SA.7.26+2SA.7.27+2SA.7.28+2SA.7.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 7:1-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Dawidi amaze kwinjira ingoro yiwe, abarira ūvugishwa n’Imana Natani, at’ Ehe jewe mba mu nzu yubakishijwe amasederi, na yo isandugu y’isezerano ry’Uhoraho iba mw ihema gusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natani yishura Dawidi, ati Kora nk’uko wumva ugomba kwose, kukw Imana iri kumwe nawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arikw iryo joro nyene ijambo ry’Imana riza kuri Natani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.28.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ngo 28:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "riti Genda ubgire umusavyi wanje Dawidi, ut’ Uku ni k’Uhoraho agize, uti Nta nzu uzomwubakira yo kubamwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ut’ Erega ntiyigeze kuba mu nzu uhereye igihe yadūganiye Abisirayeli gushitsa n’ubu, uti Yaba mw ihema akimukira mu rindi, yimuka mu rusago akaja mu rundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uti Mbeg’ ahantu hose yagiye agendana n’Abisirayeli bose, uti Har’ aho yigeze kubarira umucamanza w’Abisirayeli uw’ ari we wese, uwo yashizeho kuragira abantu biwe, akamubaza, ati N’iki cababujije kumwubakira inzu y’amasederi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero, ukw abe ari k’ubarira umusavyi wanje Dawidi, ut’ Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo, uku ni kw agize, uti Yagukūye mu bgungere, inyuma y’intama, ng’ube segaba w’abantu biwe b’Abisirayeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uti Kandi yagendana nawe aho waja hose, ut’ Arandura abansi bawe bose imbere yawe; uti Kand’ azoguha izina, nk’ukw abandi bahambaye bo mw isi bayafise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uti Kand’ abantu biwe b’Abisirayeli azobagenera ahantu, ahababadike, bahībēre ar’ ahabo bgite, batazohimuka ukundi; uti Kand’ abantu b’ibirara ntibazosubira kubakubagura nk’ubga mbere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nko mu bihe yaha abacamanza kuganza abantu biwe b’ Abisirayeli; uti Kand’ azomara igabo abansi bawe bose. Uti Mber’ Uhoraho arakubariye yukw azokugira igisata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uti Hanyuma imisi yawe ni yashika, ukaja kwisangira ba sogokuruza, ut’ Azokwimika umwe mu bana bawe, agusubirire mu gishingo, uti Kand’ azokomeza ingoma yiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ut’ Uwo ni we azomwubakira ingoro, uti Kand’ azokomeza intebe yiwe y’ubgami gushitsa ibihe vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 15:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 1:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ut’ Azomubera se, na we amubere umwana; ut’ Ariko ntazomukūrakw imbabazi ziwe nk’uko yazikūye ku wagutanguriye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.28.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ngo 28:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.1.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 1:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uti Kand’ azomuha kwama ashikamye mu ngoro yiwe no mu bgami bgiwe ibihe vyose; uti Kand’ ingoma yiwe izohora ihangamye ibihe vyose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ ayo majambo yose n’ ukwo kwerekwa kwose, Natani abidondera Dawidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ umwami Dawidi arinjira, yicara imbere y’Uhoraho, aravuga, at’ Uhoraho Mana, mbega jewe n’inda n’indēsho, n’inzu yanje, nar’ iki, kubona wagiye unzigama gushitsa n’ubu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ivyo kuri wewe vyari vyoroshe, Mana; ariko non’ uvuga n’ ivy’ inzu yanje jewe umusavyi wawe, vy’igihe kirekire kir’ imbere, ukandāba nk’aho nd’umuntu w’icubahiro cinshi, Uhoraho Mana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Non’ ikindi jewe Dawidi nokubgira n’iki, ku vy’icubahiro ngiriwe? Kuk’ uranzi, jewe umusavyi wawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewe Uhoraho, ivyo vyose bikomeye wabikoze kubganje jewe umusavyi wawe, nk’uko wavyigombeye mu mutima wawe, kugira ng’ umenyekanishe ivyo bikomeye vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewe Uhoraho, nta wuhwanye nawe, kandi nta yindi Mana iriho twigeze kwumva atari wewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Har’ irindi hanga na rimwe mw isi rihwanye n’abantu bawe b’Abisirayeli, abo wewe, Mana, wisidukiye ugacungura, ukabagira abawe, kugira ngo wironkere izina rya rurangiranwa, ugakora ibikomeye n’ibiteye ubgoba, ukirukana amahanga imbere y’abantu bawe, abo wacunguye ukabakūra muri Egiputa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw abantu bawe b’Abisirayeli wabagize abantu bawe wiharije ibihe vyose; kandi nawe, Uhoraho, wababereye Imana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko none, Uhoraho, ijambo uvuze kuri jewe umusavyi wawe no ku nzu yanje ni rikomezwe ibihe vyose, kand’ ushitse ivyo uvuze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ izina ryawe ni rikomezwe, rishemagizwe gushitsa ibihe bidashira, baze bavuge, bat’ Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo ni yo Mana y’Abisirayeli, eka mbere ni yo Mana y’Abisirayeli; kandi n’inzu yanje, jewe umusavyi wawe Dawidi, izokwama itsindaje imbere yawe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
